                    "message": "/  use like this instead 3 hashes # Power On Test Cases\nStyle Consistency: Maintains uniform comment formatting across the codebase"
                },
                {
                    "file": "gui/gui_test/overview_menu/test_overview_menu.robot",
                    "line": 415,
                    "reviewer": {
